吞蝦湯拉麵」，湯頭是蝦頭精煉湯融合雞白湯，香氣濃郁卻不厚重，一口下去整個人都暖起來。麵條是細麵、吸湯力超強，搭配整隻蝦仁雲吞、炙烤舒肥雞叉燒、溏心蛋、黑木耳，每一口都很有層次。\n\n最喜歡那片雞叉燒，外層微微焦香、裡面還保有嫩度，真的超驚艷。整碗湯喝完也不膩，是那種「濃郁又乾淨」的香氣。\n\n店員服務親切、上餐速度快，環境乾淨又有氛圍感。",null,[0,65]]]],[null,1761280422000000,1761280422000000,"10 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfZWpRdnQyZWo2U3YzekpvQnEtYnlKdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfZWpRdnQyZWo2U3YzekpvQnEtYnlKdxoTQ2d3SXBvUHN4d1lRdnVXLTZRRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjw8b-nwNKWAxXpdvUHHYMLIhkQ_2MIiwEoCg"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10372698981085246455/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTTJWRlNuUlBWM1EwVlRBNWMyVnJhM2xTVm1SclRWaHJlR1JIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10372698981085246455/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTTJWRlNuUlBWM1EwVlRBNWMyVnJhM2xTVm1SclRWaHJlR1JIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10372698981085246455/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTTJWRlNuUlBWM1EwVlRBNWMyVnJhM2xTVm1SclRWaHJlR1JIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10372698981085246455/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTTJWRlNuUlBWM1EwVlRBNWMyVnJhM2xTVm1SclRWaHJlR1JIWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10372698981085246455/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTTJWRlNuUlBWM1EwVlRBNWMyVnJhM2xTVm1SclRWaHJlR1JIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10372698981085246455/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvTTJWRlNuUlBWM1EwVlRBNWMyVnJhM2xTVm1SclRWaHJlR1JIWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝您的喜歡！",null,[0,7]]]],[null,null,5354,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toM2VFSnRPV3Q0VTA5c2Vra3lSVmRrTVhreGRHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x743ae20c0081e3a0!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkh3eEJtOWt4U09sekkyRVdkMXkxdGc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"]